>\n              — Free copy of the bilingual edition of Homeland (Official Portuguese Representation at the Venice Biennale 2014)<br>\n              — Free copy of all Triennale publications during the 2016-2018 triennium, including the 4th edition<br>\n <form action=\"https://www.paypal.com/cgi-bin/webscr\" method=\"post\" target=\"_blank\">\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"cmd\" value=\"_s-xclick\">\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"hosted_button_id\" value=\"53MM3A2ADCP52\">\n<input type=\"image\" src=\"http://www.trienaldelisboa.com/theformofform/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/paypal.png\" border=\"0\" name=\"submit\" alt=\"PayPal - The safer, easier way to pay online!\">\n<img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://www.paypalobjects.com/pt_PT/i/scr/pixel.gif\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\">\n</form>   \n              </p>\n            </div>      \n        \n        <h3 class=\"titulo\"><strong>Make a donation of any amount</strong></h3>\n           <div>\n             <p><br>\nFor donations lower than 49€ we offer a postcard collection or an Open House Lisboa t-shirt in the available sizes **<br>\n<form action=\"https://www.paypal.com/cgi-bin/webscr\" method=\"post\" target=\"_blank\">\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"cmd\" value=\"_s-xclick\">\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"hosted_button_id\" value=\"JV9T3BKKYHCSU\">\n<input type=\"image\" src=\"http://www.trienaldelisboa.com/theformofform/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/paypal.png\" border=\"0\" name=\"submit\" alt=\"PayPal - The safer, easier way to pay online!\">\n<img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://www.paypalobjects.com/pt_PT/i/scr/pixel.gif\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\">\n</form>\n</p>\n           </div>\n        </div>\n\n<p><br><br>If your company would like to support the activities of the Triennale, please contact us:<br>Joana Salvado, tel: + 351 218 259 445.</p>\n\n\n      </div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n\n<!-- footer -->\n<footer>\n <div class=\"footer\">\n  <div class=\"container-fluid\">\n    <div class=\"row\">\n     